tel 1.0 propensive.dev/bolt

# Bolt codes of TEL: `subdivision 1` / `error 7` is ↯/t.1.7, which the TEL
# Specification formerly called E107. Subdivisions 1 to 5 are defined by the
# specifications in the `tel` repository, and are common to every
# implementation; subdivision 6 is the `tel` tool's own.
#
# This is the record of the letter `t` which the index of bolt codes, `projects.tel` in
# propensive/bolt, names; its schema is `bolt.tel` there. A code, once assigned, is permanent:
# a number is never reused, and one which is withdrawn stays, marked `retired`.

project t tel

  subdivision 1 parsing
    summary  errors in a document's syntax (TEL Specification §19.3)
    error 1
      summary  BOM present at start of document
    error 2
      summary  Pragma is not the first non-blank line
    error 3
      summary  Pragma line extends beyond first 4096 bytes
    error 4
      summary  Invalid pragma version
    error 5
      summary  Invalid sigil character
    error 6
      summary  Line does not begin with the margin
    error 7
      summary  Odd indentation
    error 8
      summary  Trailing spaces on ordinary line
    error 9
      summary  Comment must follow a blank line, another comment, or start of document
    error 10
      summary  Line indent does not match any open compound's indent (reserved: the canonical parser never raises it)
    error 11
      summary Over-indentation
    error 12
      summary  Line would become a child of a tabulated row
    error 13
      summary  Source atom already present on this compound
    error 14
      summary  Literal atom already present on this compound
    error 15
      summary  Unclosed literal atom
    error 16
      summary  Tabulated row has wrong indentation
    error 17
      summary  Hard space does not end at a column boundary
    error 18
      summary  Column value exceeds maximum width
    error 19
      summary  Malformed tabulation heading
    error 20
      summary  Line-ending inconsistency
    error 21
      summary  Pragma phrase matches no pragma form
    error 22
      summary  Pragma phrases violate the positional order or multiplicity
    error 23
      summary  Document is not well-formed UTF-8
    error 24
      summary  Layer selections are not in the schema's declaration order

  subdivision 2 schema
    summary  errors in a schema (TEL Specification §20.1)
    error 1
      summary  Duplicate keyword within a Struct
    error 2
      summary  Select member has empty variants list
    error 3
      summary  Scalar has non-null default but member is not required
    error 4
      summary  Two or more Layers share the same name
    error 5
      summary  Layer Select variant keyword overlaps existing keyword in base Struct
    error 6
      summary  Layer Field merge requires both base and layer types to be Struct
    error 7
      summary  Schema.sigil character is not permitted
    error 8
      summary  Keyword `tel` is reserved and must not be used as a Field or Variant keyword
    error 9
      summary  Reference does not resolve to a Definition in the schema
    error 10
      summary  Two or more Definitions share the same name
    error 11
      summary  `exclude K` names a keyword that does not identify a Select variant in the merged Struct
    error 12
      summary  `exclude K` would empty a required Select
    error 13
      summary  Layer attempts to add a variant to an existing Select in a non-subtyping way
    error 14
      summary  Layer cannot loosen a required member to optional
    error 15
      summary  Layer cannot loosen an irrepeatable member to repeatable
    error 16
      summary  Exclude operation appears outside a layer's SelectDefinition body
    error 17
      summary  Reference/SelectRef kind mismatch (Reference resolved to a SelectDefinition, or SelectRef resolved to a Record/Scalar)
    error 18
      summary  Layer declares a conflicting encoding for an existing scalar
    error 19
      summary  Key field's type does not resolve to a Scalar
    error 20
      summary  Key field must be effectively required and non-repeatable
    error 21
      summary  More than one key field in a Struct
    error 22
      summary  Invalid RE2 pattern
    error 23
      summary  Layer pattern replacement is not contained in the inherited patterns
    error 24
      retired
      summary  Formerly: a scalar declares neither `validate` nor `pattern`
    error 25
      summary  Scalar `width` is not a positive decimal byte count
    error 26
      summary  Layer declares a conflicting width for an existing scalar, or the width contradicts the encoding's fixed width
    error 27
      summary  Scalar declares a `width` but no `encoding`
    error 28
      summary  Field with an index is not repeatable, or its type is neither a Struct nor a Scalar, or a Scalar-typed field's index path is not the root path
    error 29
      summary  Index path is not a syntactically valid TELP, or is the root path on a non-Scalar field
    error 30
      summary  Index path does not resolve statically to a non-repeatable Scalar through non-repeatable Field members
    error 31
      summary  Scalar declares both `width` and `intern`

  subdivision 3 validation
    summary  a document which does not conform to its schema (TEL Specification §21.9)
    error 1
      summary  Compound's type is not a Struct
    error 2
      summary  More atoms than assignable member positions
    error 3
      summary  Atom appears at a member position that is not atom-assignable
    error 4
      summary  Atom text matches no variant keyword of a Select member
    error 5
      summary  Atom text does not match a Field member's Flag keyword
    error 6
      summary  Compound keyword is not recognized for its parent type
    error 7
      summary  Required member absent and no default available
    error 8
      summary  Non-repeatable member is filled more than once
    error 9
      summary  Compound children of the same member are not contiguous
    error 10
      summary  Scalar value failed validation
    error 11
      summary  Flag-typed compound has atoms or compound children
    error 12
      summary  Scalar value rejected by its type's codec encoder
    error 13
      summary  Scalar type names a codec the codec binding does not provide
    error 14
      summary  Duplicate key value among keyed children of one parent
    error 15
      summary  Scalar value does not match a declared pattern

  subdivision 4 bintel
    summary  errors in decoding BinTEL (BinTEL Specification §10)
    error 1
      summary  magic number absent or invalid
    error 2
      summary  malformed variable-length integer
    error 3
      summary  invalid schema signature length
    error 4
      summary  schema signature does not decode against the library
    error 5
      summary  keyword index out of range
    error 6
      summary  scalar value length extends beyond end of input
    error 7
      summary  scalar value is not valid UTF-8
    error 8
      summary  framing error: input bytes remain after document root
    error 9
      summary  end of input reached mid-decode
    error 10
      summary  Reference type does not resolve to a Definition
    error 11
      summary  embedded schema body signature mismatch (self-contained mode)
    error 12
      summary  embedded schema body is not a valid tels document (self-contained mode)
    error 13
      summary  scalar's declared encoding is not resolved by the codec binding
    error 14
      summary  encoded scalar's value bytes rejected by the codec decoder
    error 15
      summary  codec canonicality check failed: re-encoded bytes differ
    error 16
      summary  declared document length disagrees with the structural extent

  subdivision 5 ratel
    summary  errors in reading RaTEL (RaTEL Specification §14)
    error 1
      summary  Magic number is not `B1 C4 B5 BB`
    error 2
      summary  Unsupported version byte
    error 3
      summary  Reserved header byte or reserved flag bit non-zero
    error 4
      summary  File shorter than 200 bytes; committed length `< 200`, greater than the file, or not a multiple of 8
    error 5
      summary  A section directory entry is misaligned, has `length > capacity` or a region `length` that is not a multiple of 4, has an offset `< 200`, extends beyond the committed length, or (for a fixed-size section) has `length ≠ capacity`
    error 6
      summary  Two non-empty extents overlap, or one overlaps the header
    error 7
      summary  A digest does not match; the digests section's length is not `64`, or it is not the last extent (flag bit 0 set); or flag bit 0 is clear and the digests section's capacity is not `0`
    error 8
      summary  Schema signature structurally invalid — the ↯/t.4.3 conditions
    error 9
      summary  Embedded schema body does not decode under `tels` — the ↯/t.4.12 condition
    error 10
      summary  Recomputed composed signature differs from the carried signature — the ↯/t.4.11 condition
    error 11
      summary  The schema cannot be laid out: unresolvable `Reference`/`SelectRef` (the ↯/t.4.10 condition), `intern` on a fixed-width scalar, a secondary-index path that does not resolve per §9.1
    error 12
      summary  Table directory inconsistent with the layout: wrong `rowSize`, unknown `layout` byte, non-zero reserved bytes, misaligned offset, rows exceeding the section
    error 13
      summary  Table 0 does not have exactly one row
    error 14
      summary  A ref is not a multiple of 4; an item's header or body extends beyond its region's length; a growable item has `count > capacity`
    error 15
      summary  A record index is `≥` its table's count, or a range's `start + count` exceeds it
    error 16
      summary  A row reached twice during materialisation — aliasing or a cycle
    error 17
      summary  A select tag is not the keyword index of one of the member's variants
    error 18
      summary  A text scalar's bytes are not valid UTF-8 — the ↯/t.4.7 condition
    error 19
      summary  An encoding named by the schema is not resolved by the codec binding — the ↯/t.4.13 condition
    error 20
      summary  A codec's decoder rejects a value's bytes — the ↯/t.4.14 condition
    error 21
      summary  OPTIONAL re-encode check found `encode(decode(b)) ≠ b` — the ↯/t.4.15 condition
    error 22
      summary  *Writer or owner:* a value of a `width w` scalar encodes to other than `w` bytes; the writer refuses. Never a reader condition
    error 23
      summary  Index directory, page or entry malformed: unknown kind, bad page size, entry count differing from `M`, non-zero reserved bytes, page fields out of range (§5.6, §9.4), an entry that does not parse
    error 24
      summary  An index violates the B+tree invariants of §9.4: entries or separators out of order, leaves at unequal depths, a page reached twice, a broken or cyclic leaf chain
    error 25
      summary  An index entry disagrees with the rows: host or child out of range, child outside the host's range, recomputed components differ, or the count differs from the children at the site
    error 26
      summary  Non-zero bytes in an absent member's slot or in padding
    error 27
      summary  The header's value hash differs from the BLAKE3-256 value hash of the materialised document
    error 28
      summary  Invalid state: flag bit 0 or 1 set without bit 2, or bits 2 and 3 both set; or a sealed file that is not compact (§5.8)
    error 29
      summary  The file is dirty
    error 30
      summary  A row header is inconsistent: reserved flag bits set, a live row's parent or link not naming the slot that reaches it, or a live row that is never reached

  subdivision 6 tool
    summary  the `tel` command and its language server
    error 1 schema-unresolved
      summary  a pragma names a schema which is not in the registry (information)
    error 2 layer-unknown
      summary  a pragma selects a layer its schema does not declare
    error 3 signature-disagrees
      summary  a pragma's signature disagrees with the reference or selections beside it
    error 4 unresolvable
      summary  the path of a file to validate could not be resolved
    error 5 unreadable
      summary  a file to validate could not be read
    error 6 server-terminated
      summary  the language server terminated abnormally
    error 7 transport-failed
      summary  the language server's transport failed
    error 8 unrecognised-command
      summary  the command was not recognised
    error 9 schemas-unlistable
      summary  the registry's schemas could not be listed
    error 10 schema-not-added
      summary  a schema could not be added to the registry
    error 11 signature-uncomputable
      summary  a schema's signature could not be computed
    error 12 schema-unknown
      summary  no schema of that name is in the registry
    error 13 upgrade-not-applied
      summary  a staged upgrade of the tool was not applied
    error 14 upgrade-not-staged
      summary  an upgrade of the tool could not be staged
